This may be old old news but I don't remember it in spoilers.  When
caught in a bear trap, digging down with a pick-axe replaces being in a
bear trap with being in a pit.  Zapping with a wand of digging makes a
hole and you fall through.  In both cases the bear trap is gone, which
arguably makes sense -- trap has been destroyed by the demolition work.
I'm not sure if it's faster in game to dig and escape from the pit than
to escape from the bear trap, but it feels faster as a player.

